cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LLARS in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "LLARS - LLM Assisted Research System"
abstract: >-
  LLARS is a source-available platform (free for research) for collaborative
  prompt engineering, batch generation and hybrid (human + LLM) evaluation
  of LLM outputs, with inter-rater reliability metrics. Built for research
  teams.
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
type: software
